      "content": "hey i think something is seriously wrong with my digital footprint. i tried logging into my old linux forum account today and it just says \"user not found\" but i know the credentials are right. then i checked my secondary email and some old threads i was part of are just... gone. like the posts were cleared. it feels weirdly targeted. can you help me look into if there's a pattern here or if this is just some massive server error?",
